#2600
Credits Room~
This is an area Enki found on RavenMUD one day.  It was unlinked, and the
the origional author.  It was a super-lowbie area.  Mobs with 1000 exp.
I upped it a bit and tweaked the area to fill a nitch i think raven
needed filling.
There'll be some useful pots/scrolls in here, and otherwise it may be good
fun for goodies of level 35+ (maybe 40+) solo.
Remodeling began on 7-5-02.  Opened on 7-6-02.
~
