#2660
Along a Windy Trail on the Rim of the Valley~
You are on a narrow trail on the rim of the Valley of the Elves.  Below you,
you can see the valley, filled with wild flowers and tall, green grasses.  
Within inches of your feet is the start of a nearly vertical path down the
slope.  The path appears covered in several spots with a covering of fine
gravel and in other spots there appear to be scoured patches, as though a slide
had erased the path.  This looks extremely hazardous as you can't even see more
than 15-20 feet of the downwards path.  You could easily get stuck farther down
and not be able to climb out..  You might even be hit by a rockslide.    
~
